{
  "name": "crv-evidence-v1",
  "description": "Cited CRV research evidence: scientific and experimental reports, geometallurgy, environmental studies, procedures, reference literature and LIMS commercial documents. Collections and site_ids are reported filing context, not approved scientific assertions. Cite source_uri and original_page_numbers or source_locators. For converted Office sources pages refer to the retained derived PDF; original_source_uris retains the original. Templates and commercial documents are not experimental results. Generated descriptions are explicitly marked. Access remains deny-all until authorized ACL enforcement is implemented.",
